  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Paralyzing Gaze — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>At 6th level, whenever a target you can see makes an attack roll while within 60 ft or the attack is against you, you can spend 2 CE to force that creature to make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failure, they have disadvantage on the attack roll. A creature under the effects of <em>Immobilizing Eyes</em> automatically fails this saving throw.</p>",
